Hi {Owner},

I build websites for podiatry and foot clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has strong reviews, but no site where someone searching for heel pain, an ingrown toenail or custom orthotics can see what the appointment involves and book it.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a page for each common foot condition, orthotics from assessment to fit check, diabetic foot checks, nail surgery aftercare, gait assessment and a booking request that keeps health details off the form. It uses marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes after clinic hours?

